804: |---|---|---|---|---|---|
805: | **Arrow Left** | `37` | `ArrowLeft`, `Left` | Direct seek backward -10s, wake HUD, show seek toast | Navigate focus left across OSD buttons; if Scrubber focused: fine scrub -10s | Navigate left or ignore |
806: | **Arrow Right** | `39` | `ArrowRight`, `Right` | Direct seek forward +10s, wake HUD, show seek toast | Navigate focus right across OSD buttons; if Scrubber focused: fine scrub +10s | Navigate right or ignore |
807: | **Arrow Up** | `38` | `ArrowUp`, `Up` | Wake HUD, focus `#osd-play-btn`, reset 4000ms timer | Navigate focus up: Actions -> Scrubber -> Top Back Btn | Move focus up item in modal list |
808: | **Arrow Down** | `40` | `ArrowDown`, `Down` | Wake HUD, focus `#osd-play-btn`, reset 4000ms timer | Navigate focus down: Top Back Btn -> Scrubber -> Actions | Move focus down item in modal list |
809: | **Enter / OK** | `13` | `Enter` | Wake HUD, toggle Play/Pause | Activate currently focused control (Play/Pause, Rewind, Forward, Subtitles, Server) | Select highlighted item & close modal |
810: | **Back Key** | `461`, `27` | `Back`, `Escape`, `XF86Back` | Teardown player & return to Details view | Teardown player & return to Details view | Close active modal, restore focus to trigger button |
811: | **Media Play** | `415`, `179` | `MediaPlay`, `Play` | Start playback, wake HUD briefly | Start playback, reset 4000ms timer | Ignored |
812: | **Media Pause** | `19` | `MediaPause`, `Pause` | Pause playback, wake HUD, stay visible | Pause playback, keep HUD visible | Ignored |
813: | **Media Play/Pause** | `179` | `MediaPlayPause` | Toggle play/pause | Toggle play/pause | Ignored |
814: | **Media Stop** | `413`, `178` | `MediaStop`, `Stop` | Teardown player & return to Details view | Teardown player & return to Details view | Close modal & teardown player |
815: | **Media Fast Forward** | `417`, `228` | `MediaFastForward`, `FastForward` | Seek forward +10s, wake HUD, show toast | Seek forward +10s, reset timer | Ignored |
816: | **Media Rewind** | `412`, `227` | `MediaRewind`, `Rewind` | Seek backward -10s, wake HUD, show toast | Seek backward -10s, reset timer | Ignored |
